"html": "<h3>THE PHOENIX CHRONOLOGY</h3>\n<p>3895 BC — Year 1 — Year One begins — 138 x 0</p>\n<p>2815 BC — Year 1,080 — GP completed</p>\n<p>2239 BC — Year 1,656 — Great Flood — 138 x 12</p>\n<p>1963 BC — Year 1,932 — Phoenix transit — 138 x 14</p>\n<p>1687 BC — Year 2,208 — Ogygian Deluge — 138 x 16</p>\n<p>1447 BC — Year 2,448 — Exodus</p>\n<p>1135 BC — Year 2,760 — AXIS CONJUNCT — 138 x 20</p>\n<p>583 BC — Year 3,312 — Thales — 138 x 24</p>\n<p>522 AD — Year 4,416 — Justinian Darkness — 138 x 32</p>\n<p>1902 AD — Year 5,796 — Red Mud Event — 138 x 42</p>\n<p>2040 AD — Year 5,934 — NEXT PHOENIX — 138 x 43</p>\n<p>2106 AD — Year 6,000 — Capstone / Year 6000</p>\n<p>The Axis Conjunct (1135 BC) marks the palindrome midpoint.</p>\n<p>Events before mirror events after.</p>"
