"html": "<h3>RESEARCHERS CONTACTED &amp; SOURCES CONSULTED</h3>\n<p><em>CONTACTED (PHONE, FAX <strong>&amp;</strong> LETTER) / STUDIED ON THE RECORD:</em></p>\n<p>Jason Breshears — Archaix, Willis TX — Phoenix cycle</p>\n<p>Christopher Dunn — Manufacturing engineer — Precision analysis</p>\n<p>Jacques Grimault — Author, France — Pyramid mathematics</p>\n<p>Patrice Pooyard — Director, France — La Revelation</p>\n<p>Larry Pahl — AIPR — Measurement verification</p>\n<p>John Canal — Independent — Golden ratio</p>\n<p>Dr. Elisabeth Harrington — Mathematician — Pi/phi encoding</p>\n<p>Amelia Harrington — Researcher — Measurement systems</p>\n<p>Prof. Martin Delaney — Architectural historian — Sacred geometry</p>\n<p>I.M. Pei (d. 2019) — Louvre architect — documented statements</p>\n<p>Dr. Robert Schoch — Boston University — Sphinx erosion</p>\n<p>Robert Bauval — Author — Orion Correlation</p>\n<p>Graham Hancock — Author — Lost civilizations</p>\n<p>Dr. Zahi Hawass — Former Minister — conventional position (public record)</p>\n<p><em>IN-PERSON FIELDWORK:</em></p>\n<p>Hakim Badaway — Informant, Giza plateau</p>\n<p>Patrice Pooyard — Documentary research, Egypt</p>\n<p>Bradley Rogue &amp; “Hakim Badaway” – Giza, 2023</p>"
