"html": "<p>To the stone itself, which has spoken for five millennia.</p>\n<p>To Petrie, who measured with precision unmatched in his era.</p>\n<p>To Breshears, who identified the Phoenix cycle that structures everything.</p>\n<p>To Dunn, who examined the precision with an engineer’s eye.</p>\n<p>To Grimault and Pooyard, whose documentary catalyzed this investigation.</p>\n<p>To every telephone voice who shared expertise with a stranger.</p>\n<p>To Hakim Badaway, who provided access when I finally visited.</p>\n<p>To my family, who tolerated the 138 experience — 12,834 days of obsession.</p>\n<p>And to you, reader, who engaged seriously with these ideas.</p>\n<p>The data belongs to the monument, not the man.</p>\n<p>The truth belongs to whoever reads it.</p>"
